<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A3" title="In Towards a Golden Classifier-Free Guidance Path via Foresight Fixed Point Iterations" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">C </span>Proofs</span></a>
