<div id="algorithm2.4.11" class="ltx_listingline"><span id="algorithm2.4.11.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span><span id="algorithm2.4.11.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">  </span>
